{"steam_appid":3895080,"steam_name":"Motorcycle Ride: Infinity","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3895080/1324369351/5221b8ce0035b1ecfa86b536405dce339f30c709/1792916112/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1792918319","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257477284/7e2ce71caccdb1e9540b3b60d9ac8febdb2b6778/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1792918319","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895080/4690a52a38cd2d3a786822cdcc91fd495959b374/ss_4690a52a38cd2d3a786822cdcc91fd495959b374.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793984431","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895080/dd34db6b8fcf18f2eab4f0fcdf456c36c6ee9cdf/ss_dd34db6b8fcf18f2eab4f0fcdf456c36c6ee9cdf.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793984431","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895080/fc9314c07392ec101a28ef4ee82662e7149455ed/ss_fc9314c07392ec101a28ef4ee82662e7149455ed.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793984431","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895080/8e89685b106433a91140cd7821f2a7fd89142a23/ss_8e89685b106433a91140cd7821f2a7fd89142a23.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793984431","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895080/18447063d105b6e0d1f8317b1ae50b0176aef91d/ss_18447063d105b6e0d1f8317b1ae50b0176aef91d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793984431"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Motorcycle Ride: Infinity – Turn on your music. Hit the throttle. Ride without limits.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Hit the open road, weave through traffic and experience the freedom of motorcycle riding. Explore different highways, collect bikes, customize your ride and push your limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895080/extras/4b875db53937b5fd114115c0cbb236f3.poster.avif?t=1793984431\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895080/extras/4b875db53937b5fd114115c0cbb236f3.webm?t=1793984431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895080/extras/4b875db53937b5fd114115c0cbb236f3.mp4?t=1793984431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RIDE YOUR WAY</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore highways, mountain roads and scenic routes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride through traffic, perform wheelies and push past 250 km/h.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy first-person riding with immersive engine and exhaust sounds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to your music while chasing distance records on the Steam leaderboards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895080/extras/1ff75c36229b07249d05cd8ae57e64a4.poster.avif?t=1793984431\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895080/extras/1ff75c36229b07249d05cd8ae57e64a4.webm?t=1793984431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895080/extras/1ff75c36229b07249d05cd8ae57e64a4.mp4?t=1793984431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR GARAGE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn money, buy new motorcycles and expand your collection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your bikes with paint, stickers and accessories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your motorcycles clean, repair damage and make them your own.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895080/extras/2c9f93ab01b6867b07ffeeb65c0cd02d.poster.avif?t=1793984431\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895080/extras/2c9f93ab01b6867b07ffeeb65c0cd02d.webm?t=1793984431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895080/extras/2c9f93ab01b6867b07ffeeb65c0cd02d.mp4?t=1793984431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAKE IT YOURS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your style with custom paint jobs and stickers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize your motorcycle with keychains, charms and plush accessories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new bikes and explore the shops from your garage.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895080/extras/53da366ada38fde2b7ee61b8ddb98739.poster.avif?t=1793984431\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895080/extras/53da366ada38fde2b7ee61b8ddb98739.webm?t=1793984431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895080/extras/53da366ada38fde2b7ee61b8ddb98739.mp4?t=1793984431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Your road. Your bike. Your ride.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Motorcycle Ride: Infinity is in active development, with more content and improvements planned for future updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Add it to your wishlist and hit the road!</strong></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 @ 2.8 GHz or AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 Ti or AMD Radeon RX 560<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Best experienced with headphones and on a SSD drive</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-9700K @ 3.6 GHz or AMD Ryzen 7 3700X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2060 or AMD Radeon RX 5700<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Best experienced with headphones and on a SSD drive</li></ul>","genres":["Indie","Racing","Simulation"],"developers":["Blightcore Studio"],"publishers":["Blightcore Studio"],"release_date":"Nov 6, 2026"}